1
00:00:00,307 --> 00:00:02,007
(Leonard:)Great.

2
00:00:02,543 --> 00:00:03,703
(Sheldon(off):)I can't sleep.

3
00:00:05,079 --> 00:00:07,809
(Leonard:)Well, I can, so shut up.

4
00:00:09,149 --> 00:00:12,279
(Sheldon(off):)Do you realize that
in less than nine hours, Arthur Jeffries...

5
00:00:12,519 --> 00:00:15,609
(Sheldon(off):)...a.k.a. Professor Proton,
will be in our apartment?

6
00:00:15,823 --> 00:00:19,453
You know if you stay up all night,
you're going to be sleepy tomorrow.

7
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:22,890
(Leonard:)And a sleepy Sheldon is a cranky Sheldon.
And a cranky Sheldon...

8
00:00:23,097 --> 00:00:26,557
(Leonard:)...is actually no different
than a regular Sheldon. Good night.

9
00:00:30,604 --> 00:00:33,234
(Sheldon(off):)I'm thinking of wearing a tuxedo.

10
00:00:34,341 --> 00:00:36,831
(Leonard:)That's not ridiculous. Good night.

11
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:42,040
(Sheldon(off):)Do you have cufflinks?

12
00:00:43,250 --> 00:00:44,650
(Sheldon:)- No.
- Just as well.

13
00:00:44,852 --> 00:00:47,752
(Sheldon(off):)Where can you rent a tuxedo
at 3:00 in the morning?

14
00:00:48,455 --> 00:00:50,615
(Leonard:)Okay. Good night.

15
00:00:52,926 --> 00:00:55,656
(Sheldon(off):)Nice to meet you, Professor Proton.

16
00:00:56,864 --> 00:01:04,024
(Sheldon(off):)Nice to meet you, Professor Proton.

